<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>West Savannah (feat. SZA)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Isaiah Rashad, SZA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Cilvia Demo</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0Gt4nGWoATcQFL38a1NRao</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.080" end="00:02.580" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.710" end="00:03.210" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.890" end="00:09.890" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.310" end="00:16.740">[00:15.11 ] Now can we fall in love while</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.740" end="00:18.510">[00:16.88]Southernplayalistic banging through the night?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.510" end="00:20.010">[00:19.61](through the night, through the night)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.470" end="00:20.970">[00:20.82](Fall in love, through the night)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.100" end="00:24.720">[00:23.09] And I ain't ever felt no type</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.720" end="00:27.750">[00:24.65]Of way about this living, do or die(do or die, do or die)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.750" end="00:30.360">[00:28.47](Type of way, do or die)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.360" end="00:32.280">[00:30.68]And when they see our age they say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.280" end="00:34.980">[00:32.44]We're young, I'll let you push me to the side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.980" end="00:36.480">[00:35.18](to the side, to the side)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.210" end="00:38.370">[00:36.58](Push me to the side)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.370" end="00:39.870">[00:38.26]At least we fell in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.390" end="00:42.660">[00:39.91]With something greater than debating suicide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.660" end="00:44.160">[00:42.72](suicide, suicide)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.830" end="00:48.690">[00:43.81](At least we fell in love) (o o o o ) (in love, love, love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.690" end="00:52.770" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(o o ) (in love love love) (o o ) (in love, love, love) (o o )</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.770" end="00:54.390" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(in love, love, love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.390" end="00:57.390">[00:48.92] How you feeling, baby?(in love, love, love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.390" end="01:01.140">[00:55.94]How you feeling, baby?(in love, love, love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.140" end="01:08.850">[01:02.32]I travel  I travel  I travel (in love, love, love) for you for you for you(in love, love, love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.850" end="01:16.170">[01:10.67]I battle (I battle, I battle) (in love, love, love) for you (for you for you) (in love, love, love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.170" end="01:18.390">[01:16.85]Hello (hello, hello)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.390" end="01:24.600">[01:21.65] Your name (your name, your name)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.600" end="01:31.200">[01:24.47] I travel (I travel, travel), for you (for you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.200" end="01:33.540">[01:32.10] Now can we fall in love while</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.540" end="01:36.510">[01:33.71]Southernplayalistic burning through the night?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.510" end="01:38.880">[01:36.93]Through the night, through the night, through the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.880" end="01:41.520">[01:39.54] And I ain't ever felt no type</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.520" end="01:43.110">[01:41.61]Of way about this living</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.110" end="01:46.410">[01:43.60](do or die, do  or die, do or die, do or die)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.410" end="01:49.110">[01:47.16] And when they see our age they say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.110" end="01:54.480">[01:49.14]We're young, I'll let you push me to the side to the side to the side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.480" end="01:56.400">[01:54.82] At least we fell in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.400" end="02:00.400">[ 01:56.44 ]With something greater than debating suicide (suicide  suicide)</p></div></body></tt>